    "text": "\u00d0ys godspel gebyra\u00f0 on mydewyntres m\u00e6sse\u00e6fen.\n\u00d0ys sceal on twelftan d\u00e6g.\n\u00d0ys godspel sceal on cyldam\u00e6ssed\u00e6g.\n\u00d0ys sceal on twelftan\u00e6fen.\n\u00d0ys sceal on wodnesd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re \u00feryddan wucan \u00e6r myddanwyntra.\n\u00d0ys sceal on wodnesd\u00e6g ofer twelftan d\u00e6g.\n\u00d0ys godspel sceal on halgan d\u00e6g.\n\u00d0ys sceal on friged\u00e6g ofer twelfta d\u00e6g.\n\u00d0is godspel sceal on Andreas m\u00e6ssed\u00e6g.\n\u00d0is sceal on friged\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re \u00feryddan wucan ofer twelftan d\u00e6g.\n\u00d0is godspel gebyra\u00f0 to ealra halgena m\u00e6ssan.\n\u00d0ys godspel sceal on \u00feone o\u00f0erne wodnesd\u00e6g ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0is godspel sceal on \u00feone feor\u00f0an sunnand\u00e6g ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0is godspel sceal on wodnesd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re \u00feryddan wucan ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0is sceal on wodnesd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re xvi wucan ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0is sceal on wodnesd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re systeo\u00f0an wucan ofer pentecosten & on friged\u00e6g innan \u00fe\u00e6re\n\u00d0ys gebyra\u00f0 to capud ieiunii on wodnesd\u00e6g.\n\u00d0ys sceal on \u00feone syxteo\u00f0an sunnand\u00e6g ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0ys sceal on \u00feone feor\u00f0an sunnand\u00e6g ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0ys godspel sceal to gangdagon.\n\u00d0ys godspell gebyra\u00f0 on \u00fe\u00e6re nygo\u00f0an wucan ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0ys sceal on \u00feone \u00feryddan sunnand\u00e6g ofer epiphaniam.\n\u00d0is gebyra\u00f0 on friged\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re twa and twentugo\u00f0an wucan ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0is sceal on wodnesd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re feor\u00f0an wucan ofer twelftan d\u00e6g.\n\u00d0is sceal on \u00feone feor\u00f0an sunnand\u00e6g ofer twelftan d\u00e6g.\n\u00d0is godspel sceal on sunnand\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re twentugo\u00f0an wucan ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0is godspel sceal on Sancte Matheus m\u00e6sse\u00e6fen.\n\u00d0is sceal on friged\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re o\u00f0re easterwucan.\n\u00d0is sceal on sunnand\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re fif & twentugo\u00f0an wucan ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0is sceal on wodnesd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re xiii wucan ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0ys godspel sceal to manegra martyra m\u00e6ssed\u00e6ge.\n\u00d0ys godspel gebyra\u00f0 to anes confessores m\u00e6ssed\u00e6ge.\n\u00d0ys godspel gebyra\u00f0 to anes martyres m\u00e6ssed\u00e6ge.\n\u00d0ys gebyra\u00f0 on \u00fe\u00e6re \u00e6rran wucan \u00e6r myda wyntra.\n\u00d0ys godspel gebyra\u00f0 on friged\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re \u00ferytteo\u00f0an wucan ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0ys sceal on wodnesd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re syxtan wucan ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0ys sceal on fryged\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re eahto\u00f0an wucan ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0ys sceal on wodnesd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re xiiii wucan ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0ys sceal on \u00feone \u00feryddan sunnand\u00e6g innan lencten.\n\u00d0ys sceal on wodnesd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re twelftan wucan ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0ys sceal on wodnesd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re forman lenctenwucan.\n\u00d0ys godspel sceal to Sancta Agnan m\u00e6ssan.\n\u00d0ys godspel sceal in octabas Petri et Pauli.\n\u00d0ys godspel gebyra\u00f0 on \u00feone \u00feryddan wodnesd\u00e6g innan lenctene.\n\u00d0ys godspel gebyra\u00f0 on \u00feone forman \u00feunresd\u00e6g innan lenctene.\n\u00d0ys godspel gebyra\u00f0 on \u00fe\u00e6re eahto\u00f0an wucan ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0ys sceal on wodnesd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re eahto\u00f0an wucan ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0ys godspel gebyra\u00f0 on Petres m\u00e6ssed\u00e6g.\n\u00d0ys godspel sceal on Sancte Laurentius m\u00e6ssed\u00e6g.\n\u00d0ys sceal on s\u00e6ternesd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re forman lencten wucan.\n\u00d0ys sceal on friged\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re fiftan wucan ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0ys sceal on wodnesd\u00e6g to \u00feam f\u00e6stene \u00e6r h\u00e6rfestes emnyhte.\n\u00d0ys sceal on Sancte Michaeles m\u00e6ssed\u00e6g.\n\u00d0is sceal on tiwesd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re \u00feryddan lenctenwucan.\n\u00d0ys sceal on \u00fe\u00e6re xxiii wucan ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0ys sceal to Sancte Paulus m\u00e6ssed\u00e6ge and to Sancte Benedictus.\n\u00d0ys sceal on \u00feone sunnand\u00e6g \u00fee man belyc\u00f0 alleluia.\n\u00d0ys godspel gebyra\u00f0 on wodnesd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re o\u00f0re lenctenwucan.\n\u00d0ys sceal on s\u00e6ternesd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re pentecostenes wucan to \u00feam ymbrene.\n\u00d0ys sceal on \u00fe\u00e6re feor\u00f0an wucan \u00e6r mydda wyntra.\n\u00d0ys sceal on wodnesd\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re fiftan wucan ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0ys sceal on \u00fe\u00e6re o\u00f0re wucan innan lenctene on friged\u00e6g.\n\u00d0ys godspel sceal on xxiii wucan ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0ys sceal on \u00fe\u00e6re wucan ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0ys sceal on friged\u00e6g on \u00fe\u00e6re nyge\u00f0an wucan ofer pentecosten.\n\u00d0ys godspel sceal on Sancte Stefanes m\u00e6ssed\u00e6g.\n\u00d0ys godspel sceal to m\u00e6nies confessores m\u00e6ssed\u00e6ge.\n\u00d0ys sceal to haligra f\u00e6mnena m\u00e6ssed\u00e6ge.\n\u00d0ys godspel gebyra\u00f0 on Sancte Sylvestres m\u00e6ssed\u00e6ge & to o\u00f0ra confessorum.\n\u00d0ys sceal on monand\u00e6g on forman f\u00e6stend\u00e6g.\n\u00d0es passio sceal on palmsunnand\u00e6g.\n\u00d0ys sceal on easter\u00e6fen.\n\u00d0ys sceal on friged\u00e6g on \u00f0\u00e6re o\u00f0re easterwucan.\n\u00d0ys sceal on friged\u00e6g innan \u00f0\u00e6re easterwucan.",
